2 · ⭐ THE SUPERIORITY CRITERION — bin 0, origin-blocked over 7 folds
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  bin 0: n = 128 cell-months, 32 events, mean observed 3.836

  arm              bias_A   bias_B     delta           95% CI of delta        sign
  B/NO-OP           3.836    3.836    +0.000   [   +0.000,    +0.000]     spans 0
  B/REAL            3.836    2.836    +0.592   [   +0.183,    +0.924]  excludes 0
  B/lam=0.00        3.836   20.025   -16.556   [  -21.133,   -13.306]  excludes 0
  B/lam=1.00        3.836    6.214    -2.471   [   -3.535,    -1.108]  excludes 0

  THE CONTROLS on the SUPERIORITY CRITERION (PREREG.md §5):
    PASS  V3  the EXACT no-op (B rebuilt from A's own pool) reads zero: delta +0.000e+00
    ⛔ V4 FIRES  V4  the ORACLE separates in B's favour: delta -2.471, CI [-3.535, -1.108]

  ================================================================================================
  ⛔⛔ V4 FIRES ⇒ THIS CRITERION IS **VOID** FOR THIS QUESTION. Not 'B is worse'.
  ================================================================================================
  ⭐ V3 passing and V4 failing together localise the fault precisely: the machinery
     (binning, pairing, origin-blocked bootstrap) is SOUND -- the exact no-op reads
     zero to machine precision -- and the STATISTIC is blind.

  THE MECHANISM, and it is not a surprise once stated: the within-bin absolute
  conditional bias compares a bin's MEAN observed to its MEAN predicted. It is a
  statistic about the LEVEL of a bin. The oracle's advantage is not level, it is
  PLACEMENT WITHIN the bin -- it ranks the bin's cells perfectly and still carries
  the empirical pool's level. ⇒ A bin-mean statistic cannot see the one thing the
  potency control is good at, so it cannot see the mechanism under test either.

  ⚠️ This is the RP-1 blindness class, measured again: #477 found 14 of 20 battery
     columns read the mean field only. This criterion is a 15th.

  ⛔ NO SECOND AMENDMENT IS MADE HERE. A-1 was forced by an undefined statistic; a
     further swap after seeing which arm wins is exactly the post-hoc selection
     C-3531 forbids and exactly the loop that produced four withdrawn definitions
     of done. ⇒ lambda* is located on a criterion whose power is ALREADY
     DEMONSTRATED -- the within-B contrast of S5 #584 §2a, where V3 and V4 both
     PASS and the REAL arm separates at -3.59 [-4.25, -3.04], 7/7 folds. S8 #587
     sweeps that one.

  38.0 s, CPU, R=400 replicate cubes per arm, zero GPU.
